# [cheats] unlimited_shinies, unlimited_spatulas and all_warps in Jellyfish
# Fields. The HUD button shows the counters at 99999 and 100; the pause menu
# then offers the taxi to every spatula.

wait 2400
press b
wait 120
hold 30 hud
wait 30
shot reg_cheat_counters 0
wait 300
press start
wait 60
shot reg_cheat_all_warps 0
